{"t":"Thais Bandit Cave","s":"thais-bandit-cave-75173","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Bandit_29d6e5.gif","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Thais Bandit Cave</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Bandit\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bandit_29d6e5.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, near south gate, here.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All vocations.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Level &amp; Skills' Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvlknights\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"> <div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">20</span> and 50 / 45 (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">20</span> and 50 / 40 (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">15</span> </div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Profit Hourly</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Experience</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Loot</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: red\"><b>Bad</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: purple\"><b>Very Bad</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Helmet\"><img alt=\"Iron Helmet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Iron_Helmet_0bb895.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Armor\"><img alt=\"Brass Armor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Brass_Armor_128ff9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bat%20Wing\"><img alt=\"Bat Wing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bat_Wing_49a34e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The Bandit Cave in <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> is a little hole near southern gate. Here you will find 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Bandit\">Bandits</a> and 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Bat\">Bats</a>.\n</p><p>To enter, you need use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a> on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Loose%20Stone%20Pile\">Loose Stone Pile</a> here. To leave the cave you can use the southern stairs where you came in or the northern stairs, to back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>.\n</p><p>Note: If you uses northern stairs, you can't enter again from there. The unique entrance is from <a href=\"#/wiki/Loose%20Stone%20Pile\">Loose Stone Pile</a> out <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bandit\"><img alt=\"Bandit\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bandit_29d6e5.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Bandit\">Bandit</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">65</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">245</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">43 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-30× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>Axe</li>\n<li>Mace (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Shield\">Brass Shield</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Leather%20Legs\">Leather Legs</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Tomato\">Tomato</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chain%20Helmet\">Chain Helmet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Armor\">Brass Armor</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Helmet\">Iron Helmet</a> (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bat\"><img alt=\"Bat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bat_78810b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Bat\">Bat</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">30</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">8 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bat%20Wing\">Bat Wing</a> (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":[]}